{"id":"3a61a4e56a6013ad","group":"27","path":"27/27-validation-2026-10-15.md","title":"缺失验证链接的内部清点摘要","display":"缺失验证链接的内部清点摘要","type":"index","metadata":{"type":"index","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-validation-2026-10-15","aliases":["27-validation-2026-10-15"],"display":"缺失验证链接的内部清点摘要","depends_on":["[[27-MOC]]"],"verification_status":"reconstructed-internal-summary-from-supplied-files","local_review_date":"2026-10-20","historical_original_supplied":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"index"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-validation-2026-10-15"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-validation-2026-10-15</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"缺失验证链接的内部清点摘要"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5244dbb38da17b8a\" href=\"?note=5244dbb38da17b8a\" title=\"27-MOC\">27-MOC</a></span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reconstructed-internal-summary-from-supplied-files"},{"key":"local_review_date","html":"2026-10-20"},{"key":"historical_original_supplied","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>本节点补齐 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5244dbb38da17b8a\" href=\"?note=5244dbb38da17b8a\" title=\"27-MOC\">27-MOC</a> 所列的历史验证链接。原始验证日志未随附件提供；下式记录本次2026-10-20修订完成后的文件清点。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_0,d_1\">\\(d_0,d_1\\)</span> 分别为旧链接日期和本次检查日期；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(o\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 表示原始历史日志是否提供，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 表示提供。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d,t,l,e,r,a,N\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(d,t,l,e,r,a,N\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 分别为定义、定理、引理、例子、本次补齐的历史摘要、数学条目及全部文件数量；原有 MOC 单独计为一个文件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"d_0\\coloneqq(2026,10,15),\\qquad d_1\\coloneqq(2026,10,20),\\qquad o\\coloneqq0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[d_0\\coloneqq(2026,10,15),\\qquad d_1\\coloneqq(2026,10,20),\\qquad o\\coloneqq0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle d,t,l,e,r,a,N\\rangle\\coloneqq\\langle216,225,1,8,8,450,459\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle d,t,l,e,r,a,N\\rangle\\coloneqq\\langle216,225,1,8,8,450,459\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a=d+t+l+e,\\qquad N=a+r+1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a=d+t+l+e,\\qquad N=a+r+1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>八个新增文件都是原目录已经引用的历史摘要入口，不增加数学定义、定理或例子的数量。压缩包交付范围采用相对原附件的修改及新增文件；未改数学条目仍由原附件提供。</p>\n<p>本条提供可复算的当前清点，不声称恢复2026-10-15的原始 JSON、哈希或工具日志。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-MOC","status":"resolved","id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-MOC]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-MOC","status":"resolved","id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本节点补齐 [[27-MOC]] 所列的历史验证链接。原始验证日志未随附件提供；下式记录本次2026-10-20修订完成后的文件清点。$d_0,d_1$ 分别为旧链接日期和本次检查日期；$o\\in\\{0,1\\}$ 表示原始历史日志是否提供，$1$ 表示提供。$d,t,l,e,r,a,N\\in\\mathbb N$ 分别为定义、定理、引理、例子、本次补齐的历史摘要、数学条目及全部文件数量；原有 MOC 单独计为一个文件。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{